opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "pkg-config, from the zcaml toolchain"
description: """
zcaml's toolchains install a patched u-config as pkg-config in their bin
directories, which searches OCAMLPATH for the packages of a dune pkg build.
There is nothing to check or install: this only tells the solver that
pkg-config is available."""
maintainer: "Shreyas Mididoddi <me@shreyascodes.tech>"
authors: ["Christopher Wellons"]
license: "Unlicense"
homepage: "https://github.com/skeeto/u-config"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/zcaml/zcaml/issues"
build: []
flags: conf
